1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,864
Collenchyma is living mechanical tissue.

2
00:00:02,864 --> 00:00:09,921
Its walls are thickened unevenly, here at the corners, with cellulose, hemicellulose and a lot of pectin.

3
00:00:09,921 --> 00:00:13,072
Pectin is what makes it flexible rather than brittle.

